& [Purpose]
  + bind one supplied inner-model artifact descriptor one proposed loaded-instance identity and one explicit detached model-loading authorization to one exact validated NHC-02 bundle
  + make later single-attempt load eligibility deterministic inspectable and replay-resistant without observing artifact bytes attempting a load or claiming loaded runtime state

& [Profiles]
  + [NHMA-001] request profile is cantor-nested-inner-model-admission-request/0.1 envelope profile is cantor-nested-inner-model-admission-envelope/0.1 verification profile is cantor-nested-inner-model-admission-verification/0.1
  + [NHMA-002] strict compact UTF-8 JSON denies unknown duplicate and trailing properties and is bounded to 1048576 bytes depth 24 fields 320 text 1024 and evidence 32

& [UpstreamBinding]
  + [NHMA-003] the complete supplied NHC-02 request envelope and verification must validate unchanged before any model admission result exists
  + [NHMA-004] inner session inner Cantor inner process parent envelope request lineage and envelope digests exactly equal the validated NHC-02 bundle and receive one domain-separated bundle digest
  + [NHMA-005] NHC-02 proposed_lineage_only lineage_correspondence_only authority ten denials six unresolved truths and all-zero effects remain conserved

& [ArtifactDescriptor]
  + [NHMA-006] artifact identity is a nonnil lowercase UUID-bearing SemanticId distinct from all seven NHC-02 operational identities and the proposed model instance and authorization identities
  + [NHMA-007] descriptor state is supplied_descriptor_unobserved; content digest is lowercase SHA256; bytes are 1 through 549755813888; format is exactly gguf; family architecture quantization provenance license-policy and safety-policy selectors are bounded opaque text or SemanticIds
  + [NHMA-008] family selector may name Needle Needle 2 or another opaque candidate but establishes no availability installation compatibility license safety performance or test fact
  + [NHMA-009] descriptor digest is domain-separated deterministic and self-excluding

& [ProposedInstance]
  + [NHMA-010] proposed model instance is a nonnil lowercase UUID-bearing SemanticId distinct from every predecessor artifact and authorization identity with state proposed_unloaded and a lowercase configuration SHA256
  + [NHMA-011] ceilings are context tokens 256 through 1048576 memory bytes 1 through 549755813888 threads 1 through 1024 GPU layers 0 through 65535 and a bounded backend selector; ceilings do not prove physical fit or support

& [LoadAuthorization]
  + [NHMA-012] authorization has its own UUID-bearing identity and exact issuer subject-inner-Cantor artifact instance action model_load policy SHA256 nonce SHA256 sequence lower and upper bounds one-attempt zero-retry bindings
  + [NHMA-013] an exact Ed25519 public key and detached signature verify over the domain-separated canonical authorization payload including the complete NHC-02 bundle digest descriptor digest instance identity and every authorization field
  + [NHMA-014] accepted disposition is authorized_for_later_single_attempt with consumption state unconsumed and authority supplied_key_cryptographic_model_load_authorization_only
  + [NHMA-015] signature correspondence does not prove policy governance signer competence key custody revocation freshness current sequence physical artifact truth or permission for this compiler to perform a load

& [RequestAndEnvelope]
  + [NHMA-016] one through 32 unique evidence references and exactly ten unresolved truths are required: artifact_file_presence_not_observed artifact_bytes_not_reacquired artifact_digest_not_physically_recomputed license_status_not_verified safety_status_not_verified provider_compatibility_not_verified resource_fit_not_verified signer_policy_governance_not_verified key_custody_revocation_freshness_not_verified and model_not_loaded
  + [NHMA-017] request digest is domain-separated SHA256 over deterministic JSON with only its own digest blanked
  + [NHMA-018] compilation emits admitted_descriptor_and_authorization_only lifecycle the unchanged request four digests and exactly fifteen denials: artifact_file_observation artifact_byte_reacquisition artifact_download artifact_install model_load_attempt model_load_completion runtime_observation provider_call inference process_launch shared_attention persistence workspace_mutation remote_access and external_effect
  + [NHMA-019] envelope digest is domain-separated deterministic and self-excluding

& [Verification]
  + [NHMA-020] verification replays every predecessor descriptor instance authorization signature range state denial unresolved authority lifecycle and digest check before reporting eight operational identities ten bound identities fifteen denials ten unresolved truths signature correspondence true and all effects zero
  + [NHMA-021] equal valid requests compile byte identically and retained evidence independently replays exact request envelope verification and manifest twice
  + [NHMA-022] upstream descriptor identity state bound signature policy nonce sequence action evidence unresolved denial authority lifecycle request envelope or fully redigested semantic mutation fails closed with typed faults and no partial output
  + [NHMA-023] production performs no filesystem environment clock process network provider model MCP Git workspace persistence remote cleanup or external effect action

& [Acceptance]
  + [NHMA-A01] source audit delineation data dual threat seven-fold canonical explosion justification solution plan matrix phase lock proof review and satisfaction signature agree exactly
  + [NHMA-A02] safe Rust exports strict forms validation compilation domain-separated digests and detached Ed25519 verification using existing dependencies only
  + [NHMA-A03] focused positive deterministic adversarial and fully redigested-laundering tests plus two bounded CLIs four-file retained evidence and a separate verifier pass debug and overflow-checked release
